---
source: text/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"rev\")"
---
Text utilities from linuxutils (colrm, column, hexdump, line, rev)

Usage: rev [OPTIONS] [FILES]...

Arguments:
  [FILES]...  Files to read. If none are given, reads from standard input

Options:
  -0, --zero     Use '\0' as the line separator instead of newline
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
